=\"prf-lede prf-story\">As of Oct 12, the record here runs 75 years, from 1951 to 2025. On the middle value of the county&rsquo;s 10 grids, October to November came in under 90% of normal in 42 of those years. In 2025 the middle got 57% of normal in August to September and 46% in September to October of 2025. Grid 12441 had its driest year in 1988 at 52%.</p>"}
